<title>NEW ZEALAND: AMP takes 6.64 pct stake in Macraes.</title>
<headline>AMP takes 6.64 pct stake in Macraes.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMP Society and AMP Investments (NZ) Ltd said in a notice to the New Zealand Stock Exchange on Monday that it became a substantial security holder in Macraes Mining Company Ltd last Friday.</p>
<p>At that date AMP had a relevant interest in 6.64 percent of Macraes' voting securities.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
</text>
